  "rules": [
    "A character listed in required_named must have a runtime representation in that chapter/route.",
    "Film/story separation beats may stop companions from following; population presence must not override canon outcomes.",
    "Dedicated production assets replace proxies incrementally; proxy presence is not visual completion.",
    "Ambient population density must remain compatible with the target laptop and distance-adaptive ticking.",
    "Do not duplicate a canonical identity as two simultaneous persistent-memory identities; aliases resolve to one profile."
